@6661. "He built cities of storehouses for Pharaoh" (Exodus 1:11) = doctrines from falsified truths in the natural where were alienated scientifics. "Cities" = doctrines in both senses.

@6693[3]. To "destroy the city" (Jeremiah 46:8) = to destroy the doctrine of the Church.

@6978[2]. "The city of bloods" (Nahum 3:1) = the doctrine of falsity.

@7102[5]. "Cities" = falsities by which they defend evils.

@7297[2]. "The city of bloods" = the falsification of truth.

