@9193[2]. "The cities" which were to be accursed (Deuteronomy 13:15, 16) = false doctrines. @--[3].

@9262[4]. "The city" nearest the slain man (Deuteronomy 21:2) = the truth of doctrine of the Church whose good is extinguished.

