@376[20]. That the doctrine of falsity will be destroyed, is signified by, "the city of emptiness is broken" (Isaiah 24:10).

@386[21]. "That they may erect a city of habitation" (Psalms 107:36) = to make for themselves the doctrine of life; "a city" = doctrine; and "habitation," life.

